{"id":"110191","name":"Meteoric Bullet","type":"Material","sub_type":"TracePath","rarity":2,"icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/item/110191.png","come_from":["Calyx: SoulGlad™ Scorchsand Audition Venue","Embers Exchange","Omni-Synthesizer — Material Exchange"],"category":"Trace Material","desc":"Iron pellets forged for hunting monsters. Each one bears scratches that seem to record the number of prey that perished because of it. Used to level up Traces slightly for The Hunt characters.","lore":"The Armed Archaeologists discovered these iron pellets among various types of monster fossils and bones. Radioactive dating confirmed that they were fired in an era when humanity did not yet exist, and the creatures they shot were the last remnants of a certain monster species.\n\n\"Death by old age is no different from death by bullet. The way of the hunter won't lead to a sacred nor sinful end.\"","usedBy":{"characters":[{"id":1015,"name":"Archer","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1015.png"},{"id":1315,"name":"Boothill","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1315.png"},{"id":1220,"name":"Feixiao","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1220.png"},{"id":1224,"name":"March 7th (Imaginary)","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1224.png"},{"id":1223,"name":"Moze","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1223.png"}],"lightCones":[{"id":-2066206607,"name":"I Venture Forth to Hunt","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/light_cone/23031.png"},{"id":1447526326,"name":"Race to the Horizon","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/light_cone/22008.png"},{"id":662511574,"name":"Sailing Towards a Second Life","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th